OL,4,CU18s team making club history in FA    
OL,5,CYouth Cup                              
OL,6,GAn under-18 football team say they do  
OL,7,Gnot fear their opponents in the next   
OL,8,Ground of the FA Youth Cup, despite     
OL,9,Gbeing drawn against a professional     
OL,10,Gacademy team.                          
OL,12,FCobham Football Club U18s have been    
OL,13,Fdrawn at home against Exeter City's    
OL,14,Facademy team in the tournament's       
OL,15,Fsecond round proper.                   
OL,17,FThe Surrey club says this is the       
OL,18,Ffurthest it has ever gone in the youth 
OL,19,Fcompetition. The team would face       
OL,20,FWrexham's academy side should they     
OL,21,Fcome out on top in the match on Friday.
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
