OL,4,CCommunity hub to close citing          
OL,5,Cfinancial challenges                   
OL,6,GA cook at a community hub cafe has     
OL,7,Gsaid she feels "punched in the         
OL,8,Gstomach" after learning services will  
OL,9,Gclose following a decision to place    
OL,10,Gthe organisation into administration.  
OL,12,FThe trustees of Romney Marsh Community 
OL,13,FHub, which supports the over 50s, said 
OL,14,Fsignificant financial challenges meant 
OL,15,Fservices were being brought to an end, 
OL,16,Fwith administrators to be appointed    
OL,17,Fwithin days.                           
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
