OL,4,CBrighton coaching clinics a            
OL,5,C'watershed' for baseball               
OL,6,GBaseball coaching clinics held in      
OL,7,GBrighton by a British Major League     
OL,8,GBaseball (MLB) star have been          
OL,9,Gdescribed as being part of a           
OL,10,G"watershed moment' for the sport in    
OL,11,Gthe UK.                                
OL,13,FHarry Ford plays for the Washington    
OL,14,FNationals and helped GB reach their    
OL,15,Ffirst ever World Baseball Classic in   
OL,16,F2023 ` the sport's biggest             
OL,17,Finternational competition.             
OL,19,FThe invite-only coaching clinics he    
OL,20,Fheld for young talent recently were    
OL,21,Fthe first from a MLB player on UK soil.
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
